Janis Papanagnou wrote:

> On 20.09.2014 22:23, Janis Papanagnou wrote:
>> On 20.09.2014 21:25, G7Nation wrote:
>> 
>>> but I don't think it makes sense to make a patch
>>> to handle your very specific situation.
